### Stripe Booking + Payment Flow

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@apiUrl = {{baseUrl}}/api

### ============================================
### VARIABLES - Update after creating booking
### ============================================
@request_id = 3c8b057c-e85f-4dbd-86e0-f159995d4e96
@booking_id = 4dd461b1-0a67-4ed9-b7a0-8d114b3aa090
@payment_intent_id = pi_3Sc5jyJHQuHCrlwI072cOPDN

### ============================================
### STEP 1: CREATE BOOKING
### Payment Intent is created automatically via Kafka (wait 2-3 seconds)
### ============================================

POST {{apiUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "seat_ids": ["seat134", "seat2343", "seat3343"]
}

### Copy "id" (booking_id) from response → update @booking_id variable above
### If response has "request_id" only, wait 2-3 seconds then use STEP 2

### ============================================
### STEP 2: GET BOOKING BY REQUEST ID (If Step 1 returned request_id)
### ============================================

GET {{apiUrl}}/bookings/request/{{request_id}}

### ============================================
### STEP 3: GET BOOKING BY ID (Check payment_intent_id + client_secret)
### ============================================

GET {{apiUrl}}/bookings/{{booking_id}}

### Verify booking has:
### - payment_intent_id exists
### - client_secret exists
### - status is "pending"

### ============================================
### STEP 4: PAY WITH FRONTEND
### ============================================
### Open in browser:
### http://localhost:3001/payment.html?booking_id={{booking_id}}
###
### Enter test card: 4242 4242 4242 4242
### Expiry: 12/25 (any future date)
### CVC: 123 (any 3 digits)
###
### Click "Pay Now" → Payment processes → Webhook confirms booking

### ============================================
### STEP 5: VERIFY BOOKING CONFIRMED (after webhook)
### Wait 2-3 seconds after payment, then check booking
### ============================================

GET {{apiUrl}}/bookings/{{booking_id}}

### Status should be "confirmed"

### ============================================
### QUICK TEST FLOW
### ============================================

### 1. Create booking
POST {{apiUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "seat_ids": ["seat100", "seat101"]
}

### 2. Wait 3 seconds, then get booking:
GET {{apiUrl}}/bookings/{{booking_id}}

### 3. Open frontend:
### http://localhost:3001/payment.html?booking_id={{booking_id}}
###
### 4. Enter test card and pay
###
### 5. Wait 2-3 seconds, then verify:
GET {{apiUrl}}/bookings/{{booking_id}}
### Status should be "confirmed"

### ============================================
### NOTES
### ============================================
### 
### 1. Payment Intent creation is ASYNC (via Kafka)
###    - Booking created immediately
###    - Payment Intent created in background (2-5 seconds)
###    - Check booking again to see payment_intent_id and client_secret
### 
### 2. Frontend Payment:
###    - Open: http://localhost:3001/payment.html?booking_id=YOUR_BOOKING_ID
###    - Frontend fetches booking and client_secret automatically
###    - Uses Stripe.js to process payment (card data never touches your backend)
###    - Stripe sends REAL webhook to your server
###    - Booking status updates after webhook processes (2-3 seconds)
### 
### 3. Webhook Processing:
###    - Real webhook sent by Stripe (not simulated)
###    - Webhook endpoint: POST /api/payments/webhook
###    - For local testing: Use Stripe CLI to forward webhooks
###      Command: stripe listen --forward-to localhost:3001/api/payments/webhook
### 
### 4. Test Cards (for frontend):
###    - Success: 4242 4242 4242 4242
###    - Decline: 4000 0000 0000 0002
###    - 3D Secure: 4000 0025 0000 3155
